libvips 8.18 branch after 8.18.7, commit 7ce6be0a2477:
https://github.com/libvips/libvips/commit/7ce6be0a2477c3578b495a22922ffc419a36cea0

webpload of an animated WebP with several pages (n=-1): the frame height times
the number of frames was computed in int and could overflow into a height that
passed the check of VIPS_MAX_COORD; now computed in 64 bits and refused when
too large ("image too large"). With the cleanups of the commit.

